{
  "type": "group",
  "label": {
    "en": "Solar forecast",
    "sv": "Solprognos"
  },
  "children": [
    {
      "id": "pv_forecast_enabled",
      "type": "checkbox",
      "label": {
        "en": "Use solar forecast in the plan",
        "sv": "Använd solprognos i planen"
      },
      "value": true,
      "hint": {
        "en": "Calibrated against your measured production, so errors in size or orientation shrink over time.",
        "sv": "Kalibreras mot din uppmätta produktion, så fel i storlek eller riktning minskar med tiden."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pv_source",
      "type": "dropdown",
      "label": {
        "en": "Forecast source",
        "sv": "Prognoskälla"
      },
      "value": "open_meteo",
      "values": [
        {
          "id": "open_meteo",
          "label": {
            "en": "Open-Meteo (free, no account)",
            "sv": "Open-Meteo (gratis, inget konto)"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "forecast_solar",
          "label": {
            "en": "Forecast.Solar (free, no account)",
            "sv": "Forecast.Solar (gratis, inget konto)"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "solcast",
          "label": {
            "en": "Solcast (free hobbyist account)",
            "sv": "Solcast (gratis hobbykonto)"
          }
        }
      ],
      "hint": {
        "en": "Open-Meteo: 15-minute irradiance and 14 days of history for a quick calibration. Forecast.Solar: hourly production estimate. Solcast: forecast for the rooftop sites set up in your Solcast account; uses the API key and site IDs below.",
        "sv": "Open-Meteo: solinstrålning per kvart och 14 dagars historik för snabb kalibrering. Forecast.Solar: produktionsprognos per timme. Solcast: prognos för takytorna i ditt Solcast-konto; använder API-nyckeln och yt-id:na nedan."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pv_weather_model",
      "type": "dropdown",
      "label": {
        "en": "Weather model (Open-Meteo)",
        "sv": "Vädermodell (Open-Meteo)"
      },
      "value": "blend",
      "values": [
        {
          "id": "blend",
          "label": {
            "en": "Five models, weighted by how well each fits (learns)",
            "sv": "Fem modeller, viktade efter hur väl var och en stämmer (lär sig)"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "metno_seamless",
          "label": {
            "en": "Yr / MET Norway",
            "sv": "Yr / MET Norge"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "icon_seamless",
          "label": {
            "en": "ICON (DWD, Germany)",
            "sv": "ICON (DWD, Tyskland)"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "ecmwf_ifs025",
          "label": {
            "en": "ECMWF (Europe)",
            "sv": "ECMWF (Europa)"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "gfs_seamless",
          "label": {
            "en": "GFS (NOAA, USA)",
            "sv": "GFS (NOAA, USA)"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "meteofrance_seamless",
          "label": {
            "en": "Météo-France",
            "sv": "Météo-France"
          }
        }
      ],
      "hint": {
        "en": "Yr, ICON, ECMWF, GFS and Météo-France. Each is scored every quarter-hour against your measured production; the ones that fit your roof best count most. Until about two days of sun are scored, the middle value is used. A single model can be chosen instead.",
        "sv": "Yr, ICON, ECMWF, GFS och Météo-France. Varje modell poängsätts varje kvart mot din uppmätta produktion; de som stämmer bäst för ditt tak väger tyngst. Tills ungefär två soldagar är poängsatta används mittvärdet. En enskild modell kan väljas i stället."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pv_model_weights",
      "type": "label",
      "label": {
        "en": "Learned model weights",
        "sv": "Inlärda modellvikter"
      },
      "value": "–"
    },
    {
      "id": "pv_api_key",
      "type": "password",
      "label": {
        "en": "API key (Solcast, or Forecast.Solar paid plan)",
        "sv": "API-nyckel (Solcast, eller Forecast.Solar betalplan)"
      },
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "solcast_sites",
      "type": "text",
      "label": {
        "en": "Solcast site IDs",
        "sv": "Solcast yt-id"
      },
      "value": "",
      "hint": {
        "en": "Resource IDs of your rooftop sites, separated by commas. Solcast allows 10 requests a day, so the app fetches at most every 2.5 hours per site.",
        "sv": "Resurs-id för dina takytor, separerade med komma. Solcast tillåter 10 anrop per dag, så appen hämtar som oftast var 2,5:e timme per yta."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pv_array1_kwp",
